## Model Identity and Background

**Developer:** Zhipu AI (Chinese AI company)
**Release Date:** 2026
**Series:** GLM (GLM-5.3 Flash)
**Predecessor:** GLM-5.2 or earlier
**License:** Proprietary (with open-source options for some variants)
**Context Window:** Not explicitly specified in available documentation

GLM is Zhipu AI's family of large language models, developed by their research team. The GLM 5.3 Flash represents the latest in this series, with "5.3" indicating the version and "Flash" indicating its optimized, faster variant. Zhipu AI is a leading Chinese AI research company with strong expertise in natural language processing and large language models.

